    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Private services: traffic, last 5 minutes",
      "description": "Every HTTPRoute behind the private Traefik gateway, with its first hostname. 4xx and 5xx are the share of that service's responses. Public routes are on the HAProxy edge board.",
